    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T19:26:55Z",
    "body": "STOPPED before claim. The requested checksum publication needs a release integration change that this task prohibits.\n\nOn upstream/main 0957b20aa, .github/workflows/release.yml:391-418 publishes explicit package extensions. It does not generate or publish checksum files.\n\nxtask/src/package.rs creates the Windows portable ZIP before the final installer exists. Linux and macOS use scripts/package-*.sh. No existing cross-platform checksum publication step exists.\n\nThe task prohibits changes to .github/ and scripts/. Adding checksum generation in xtask alone does not connect it to the final release assets.\n\nI did not claim the issue, create a branch, or change source files. The issue remains open and unclaimed.\n",
