    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T03:03:06Z",
    "body": "STOPPED before claim again. The blocker in the previous comment is still true on upstream/main bf7e68b14.\n\n- `.github/workflows/release.yml` does not make or publish a SHA-256 checksum file for the release assets.\n- The install step of this issue must check the download against that file. Without it, the install step cannot be safe.\n- The worker task does not permit changes to `.github/` or `scripts/`.\n\nSuggestion for the maintainer:\n\n1. Split this issue into three sub-issues.\n2. Sub-issue A: publish a checksum file for each release (a `.github/` and `scripts/` change, for the maintainer).\n3. Sub-issue B: the update check and the \"Update available\" item in the title bar, with the setting. `crates/ui` already has `reqwest`, so B needs no new dependency.\n4. Sub-issue C: download, verify and install. C is blocked by A.\n\nI did not claim the issue, create a branch, or change files.\n",
